<title>POLAND: LDA SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.02 MLN.</title>
<headline>LDA SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.02 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.02 vs   0.09</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.05 vs   0.15</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.04 vs   0.18</p>
<p> Sales		    2.48 vs   2.53</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.73 vs   0.42</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.29 vs   0.77</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.23 vs   1.13</p>
<p> Sales		   22.89 vs  20.23</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish printing house is Lodzka</p>
<p>Drukarnia Akcydensowa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
